I will calculate the estimated travel times for the three different journey scenarios you described.

1.  **Scenario 1:** New York → Philadelphia → Washington D.C. → Atlanta → Miami
2.  **Scenario 2:** New York → Washington D.C. → Miami (skipping Atlanta)
3.  **Scenario 3:** Philadelphia → Washington D.C. → Miami

```json
{
  "calls": [
    {
      "name": "route.estimate_time",
      "arguments": {
        "start_location": "New York",
        "end_location": "Miami",
        "stops": ["Philadelphia", "Washington D.C.", "Atlanta"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "route.estimate_time",
      "arguments": {
        "start_location": "New York",
        "end_location": "Miami",
        "stops": ["Washington D.C."]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "route.estimate_time",
      "arguments": {
        "start_location": "Philadelphia",
        "end_location": "Miami",
        "stops": ["Washington D.C."]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

